{"id": "34425", "title": "总裁的俏女郎", "author": "辰晞", "category": "文学名著", "count": 38, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34425.htm", "intro": "想她贺芸薇可是时代的新女性，怎么可能答应这种由父母安排的婚约呢？而摆脱这个麻烦最直接的办法，就是直接找上「男主角」谈判——没想到这男人竟然拒绝她的退婚，还说什么要给她三个月的时间，让她留下来说服自己改变心意！？嗯哼，放心，她一定会好好「说服」他，整得他一点都不想娶她……搞什么啊！她那样恶整他，他非但不生气、不把她赶回家，竟然还说……他绝对不会放弃她！？喔，谁来告诉她，她到底该怎么办啊？", "base": "files/article/html/34/34425", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2185370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2185371.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2185372.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2185373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2185374.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2185375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2185376.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2185377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2185378.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2185379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2185380.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2185381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2185382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2185383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2185384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2185385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2185386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2185387.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2185388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2185389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2185390.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2185391.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2185392.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2185393.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2185394.html", "available": false}, {"